{
"file": 689,
"paths": [
"d008/d055/f020"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "5e6a7daf",
"en_raw": "Hey, you can't bring a dog in here"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "9d0e6633",
"en_raw": "This is a housing complex"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "af147f3d",
"en_raw": "Clean up properly"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "48ded76b",
"en_raw": "after your dog"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "cad89998",
"en_raw": "Um"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "1045d592",
"en_raw": "you're the manager here, right?"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "524fc0f0",
"en_raw": "Yes"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "00c7b953",
"en_raw": "You, are you a Hirauchi kid?"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "3bc9fc97",
"en_raw": "It's a real problem, this, dog stuff"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "ddb96a1f",
"en_raw": "When I'm weeding"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "86ffbb36",
"en_raw": "it turns up"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "77204d46",
"en_raw": "I'll clean up the droppings properly"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "5024559a",
"en_raw": "If I find any"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "90b11e57",
"en_raw": "I'll have the owner come"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "4b426675",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "97e2e5db",
"en_raw": "No, no"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "5d01df01",
"en_raw": "Hurry up and get your dog out"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "cad89998",
"en_raw": "Um"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "1045d592",
"en_raw": "you're the manager here, right?"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "56a5c762",
"en_raw": "Need something?"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "06c855c1",
"en_raw": "I'm looking for the notice board"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "472e532e",
"en_raw": "with the city newsletter..."
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "9976d5a3",
"en_raw": "Oh, look"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "95fd8962",
"en_raw": "it's at the complex entrance"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "3812c74d",
"en_raw": "I posted it there"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "f668b62d",
"en_raw": "Ah, over there"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "a0c00b69",
"en_raw": "Thanks a lot"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "b678507d",
"en_raw": "Did you find"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "6df6af01",
"en_raw": "what you were after?"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "33471b85",
"en_raw": "Hello, out for a walk?"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "fe7dc9ce",
"en_raw": "How nice"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "02df979b",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "38a28ad6",
"en_raw": "Where's the notice board"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "9601bf45",
"en_raw": "Where was the notice board again?"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "93b7e732",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "4c9d217f",
"en_raw": "Hey, Mrs. Yamada"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "e3d632ad",
"en_raw": "do you know?"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "ced38c8d",
"en_raw": "Wasn't it posted on the board"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "14e809cb",
"en_raw": "at the complex entrance?"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "6ad4724d",
"en_raw": "I see, thanks"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "cbeaf30b",
"en_raw": "Hello"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "c6c03f90",
"en_raw": "Oh, what a cute doggy"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "51895662",
"en_raw": "It's just big"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "dfd14a72",
"en_raw": "...Shiina?"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "dee42576",
"en_raw": "A person fell down"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "e363654f",
"en_raw": "Huh?"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "90fe470f",
"en_raw": "...What is that"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "362d2004",
"en_raw": "Yeah, nobody's there"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "8f2282b6",
"en_raw": "...Yes, yes, let's go quickly"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "26140687",
"en_raw": "Shii-i-na~"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "508f3689",
"en_raw": "Yeah"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "4587a615",
"en_raw": "Come on, we're going"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "5e6a7daf",
"en_raw": "Hey, you can't bring a dog in here"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "9d0e6633",
"en_raw": "This is a housing complex"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "be540051",
"en_raw": "I told you"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "60683db2",
"en_raw": "not to bring dogs in"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "9f4d8112",
"en_raw": "No, no"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "f1063ded",
"en_raw": "Tie it up somewhere properly"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "0e87675e",
"en_raw": "Excuse me"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "bca2788a",
"en_raw": "I'd like to ask something"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "fc101ca0",
"en_raw": "Is the rumor true"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "39eab0d8",
"en_raw": "that ghosts appear in this complex?"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "19ff4e30",
"en_raw": "...Ghosts?"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "97e2e5db",
"en_raw": "No, no"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "c6dca95a",
"en_raw": "If you go spreading such talk"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "ab2e295a",
"en_raw": "No"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "1c388dd3",
"en_raw": "it's a baseless rumor"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "de40d605",
"en_raw": "A person fell down"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "80ba291d",
"en_raw": "...Huh?"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "90cbcc58",
"en_raw": "A person fell down"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "7fd705b9",
"en_raw": "...When! When!"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "607256b9",
"en_raw": "When on earth was that?"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "16934165",
"en_raw": "...Dunno"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "1229ec41",
"en_raw": "Don't scare me..."
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "65b66025",
"en_raw": "Anyway,"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "fdf887e6",
"en_raw": "enough of that kind of talk!"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "0766b8db",
"en_raw": "...Mister,"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "73625cf1",
"en_raw": "what's that about?"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "982d21b7",
"en_raw": "Hey, mister"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "4a9f7966",
"en_raw": "You know something, don't you?"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "48e5e1b7",
"en_raw": "No, no, no!"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "8e33a3d9",
"en_raw": "Don't blame me if strange rumors spread"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "d45d8813",
"en_raw": "Spirits live in Hirumidai Complex"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "1703214b",
"en_raw": "or something..."
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "8dca9aec",
"en_raw": "Give me a break..."
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "92094f5e",
"en_raw": "Come on, we won't tell anyone!"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "0e710ceb",
"en_raw": "Kids these days, why are they like this..."
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "e0694821",
"en_raw": "Yes!"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "852f0d2d",
"en_raw": "Phew..."
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "6f3311e7",
"en_raw": "How many years ago was it"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "125d7321",
"en_raw": "eleven, twelve..."
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "59c0d5a0",
"en_raw": "Thirteen years have passed since then"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "8679de19",
"en_raw": "Thirteen years ago"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "2aae2305",
"en_raw": "is the year we were born"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "b5df4643",
"en_raw": "Back then, an astonishing number"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "23028c67",
"en_raw": "of people died"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "172f0082",
"en_raw": "so they did it on a grand scale"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "3e02047f",
"en_raw": "A Shinto priest came"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "7c0d9aa2",
"en_raw": "What's that?"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "d1e0250f",
"en_raw": "It's the Bird Mound"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "d5456a3d",
"en_raw": "It was brought here"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "bdd522ec",
"en_raw": "for reasons of land development"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "993c1102",
"en_raw": "and moved onto this"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "54b7122f",
"en_raw": "complex's grounds"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "411134cd",
"en_raw": "And then, four people in a row"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "21ee62b9",
"en_raw": "jumped from up there"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "b06fc9fb",
"en_raw": "To an outsider"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "1f535f23",
"en_raw": "it'd look like a curse, sure"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "73e6be8b",
"en_raw": "I never knew such an amazing story"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "e7954418",
"en_raw": "so it was a curse?"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "5c14ca77",
"en_raw": "No way"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "e04ac772",
"en_raw": "Since back then I've"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "3e5eb9a9",
"en_raw": "worked at the management office hut"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "9f32e830",
"en_raw": "I knew all four of them"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "35299962",
"en_raw": "Well, each had their reasons"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "677c1fbe",
"en_raw": "so I can see why"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "4d658872",
"en_raw": "When life's hard"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "79fc1c22",
"en_raw": "that's when it counts, no?"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "569b3e83",
"en_raw": "More than shocked, I thought"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "82e5f722",
"en_raw": "what a pointless thing to do"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "17da47e9",
"en_raw": "By the way, that mound is now"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "771f20e7",
"en_raw": "behind the school, isn't it"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "56c6e8cb",
"en_raw": "It is"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "06af0c2c",
"en_raw": "As far as I know"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "5bec98f4",
"en_raw": "it'd be its second move"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "4bbae31a",
"en_raw": "The Bird Mound, back in the day"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "81884209",
"en_raw": "was said to bring quite a few blessings"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "a9bd59c5",
"en_raw": "Folks older than me even then"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "1bbc726d",
"en_raw": "kept saying don't move it, it'll curse"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "1b33fff5",
"en_raw": "making a fuss"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "83321e89",
"en_raw": "Those old folks now"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "faefd724",
"en_raw": "live in a care home"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "38ffbd2c",
"en_raw": "Ghosts and whatnot"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "ee2084ac",
"en_raw": "we all age and die anyway"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "f98b5309",
"en_raw": "Is that really so scary?"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "5a631334",
"en_raw": "Right, young ladies?"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "0348f425",
"en_raw": "Ha ha..."
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "4e92972b",
"en_raw": "this guy"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "7697bbae",
"en_raw": "thinks like me"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "5352b1cf",
"en_raw": "So high and mighty"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "82b959cb",
"en_raw": "I've lived"
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "0cdcc0f5",
"en_raw": "four times as long as you"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "0a7a9532",
"en_raw": "Well, don't mind it"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "a3f81fbf",
"en_raw": "Thanks, mister"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "269232f7",
"en_raw": "About what you said earlier"
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "5e8c3e16",
"en_raw": "don't tell anyone"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "6a6128dd",
"en_raw": "If strange rumors spread again"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "dc303821",
"en_raw": "I can't stand it"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "02df979b",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "7e66fbd9",
"en_raw": "There's a rumor of a wandering spirit"
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "ecc5bd3c",
"en_raw": "in this complex"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "a98700e7",
"en_raw": "Have you heard anything?"
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "2c9c5913",
"en_raw": "What?"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "c520ffdb",
"en_raw": "Ugh, creepy..."
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "396e03b5",
"en_raw": "I'm sure it's just a rumor"
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "7079cfea",
"en_raw": "but for a rumor to spread"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "6e45dc14",
"en_raw": "there must have been a cause"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "7894d852",
"en_raw": "I've never heard such a thing"
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "8357b569",
"en_raw": "Mrs. Yamada, do you know?"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "54465ed7",
"en_raw": "No, I don't know either..."
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "ba518540",
"en_raw": "I see, thanks..."
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "03ba4523",
"en_raw": "How awful"
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "80cab2d9",
"en_raw": "The manager"
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "9560e787",
"en_raw": "Do you know anything..."
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "2fae3b13",
"en_raw": "Strange..."
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "879960b4",
"en_raw": "I thought he was"
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "f972bb3a",
"en_raw": "always wandering around here..."
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "27c72f77",
"en_raw": "Um, today"
},
{
"n": 168,
"h": "22e4c41d",
"en_raw": "is the manager off?"
},
{
"n": 169,
"h": "6fded75c",
"en_raw": "Oh, haven't you seen him?"
},
{
"n": 170,
"h": "814f0601",
"en_raw": "...Oh dear"
},
{
"n": 171,
"h": "bafac279",
"en_raw": "Haven't you heard, ma'am?"
},
{
"n": 172,
"h": "a530a19c",
"en_raw": "What's wrong?"
},
{
"n": 173,
"h": "b7f9f02e",
"en_raw": ".........."
},
{
"n": 174,
"h": "4891caef",
"en_raw": "...Oh my, was that so"
},
{
"n": 175,
"h": "0caa749c",
"en_raw": "I didn't know"
},
{
"n": 176,
"h": "8f08b2b1",
"en_raw": "How sad"
},
{
"n": 177,
"h": "a7aa246b",
"en_raw": "Wait, wait, wait"
},
{
"n": 178,
"h": "287b0aef",
"en_raw": "that old man"
},
{
"n": 179,
"h": "fc7f81a9",
"en_raw": "is something wrong?"
},
{
"n": 180,
"h": "724d899b",
"en_raw": "The manager, Mr. Kono"
},
{
"n": 181,
"h": "1252037a",
"en_raw": "...passed away"
},
{
"n": 182,
"h": "70e7d7de",
"en_raw": "...Huh?"
},
{
"n": 183,
"h": "bfb0274e",
"en_raw": "He was so healthy"
},
{
"n": 184,
"h": "21077456",
"en_raw": "You never can tell with the elderly"
},
{
"n": 185,
"h": "9f7ee6fa",
"en_raw": "We have to watch out"
},
{
"n": 186,
"h": "37976c14",
"en_raw": "for my grandpa too"
},
{
"n": 187,
"h": "0b4e356f",
"en_raw": "By the way, then"
},
{
"n": 188,
"h": "6cb3ae9e",
"en_raw": "will a new manager come?"
},
{
"n": 189,
"h": "46b0b752",
"en_raw": "Apparently so"
},
{
"n": 190,
"h": "cd5efce5",
"en_raw": "A young person this time, they say"
},
{
"n": 191,
"h": "30b638a0",
"en_raw": "No way..."
},
{
"n": 192,
"h": "dd5294ac",
"en_raw": "Hey, when?"
},
{
"n": 193,
"h": "091d414f",
"en_raw": "When did he die?"
},
{
"n": 194,
"h": "c03a63da",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 195,
"h": "251ddda0",
"en_raw": "When did the manager"
},
{
"n": 196,
"h": "d274de31",
"en_raw": "pass away?"
},
{
"n": 197,
"h": "375a7f33",
"en_raw": "Yesterday, yesterday"
},
{
"n": 198,
"h": "a339acd1",
"en_raw": "Taken to the hospital late"
},
{
"n": 199,
"h": "434506e4",
"en_raw": "and just like that..., they say"
},
{
"n": 200,
"h": "dcda186d",
"en_raw": "Does he have any relatives?"
},
{
"n": 201,
"h": "35aa0a11",
"en_raw": "Mr. Kono"
},
{
"n": 202,
"h": "c1d513d6",
"en_raw": "didn't he have a wife?"
},
{
"n": 203,
"h": "bf803863",
"en_raw": "I haven't heard"
},
{
"n": 204,
"h": "bf7ce929",
"en_raw": "he was alone, I think"
},
{
"n": 205,
"h": "aa0f1bc1",
"en_raw": "Oh my, then"
},
{
"n": 206,
"h": "eedfc2b2",
"en_raw": "he really was alone..."
},
{
"n": 207,
"h": "b2e48a58",
"en_raw": "Poor man"
},
{
"n": 208,
"h": "0e4a5f90",
"en_raw": "Did you"
},
{
"n": 209,
"h": "579261f6",
"en_raw": "have something left with him?"
},
{
"n": 210,
"h": "43341c83",
"en_raw": "No, it's not that"
},
{
"n": 211,
